@startuml
title 分析状态机图（六）— 外部需求
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F5FAFF
skinparam classBorderColor #46637F
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45
hide empty description
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F5FAFF
skinparam stateBorderColor #46637F

state "待接单" as Unassigned
state "待完成" as Assigned
state "待审核" as Submitted
state "待补正" as Returned
state "已归档" as Archived
[*] --> Unassigned
Unassigned --> Assigned : 接单派发()\n[目标部门部长有权且承接成员有效]\n/ 确立唯一承接责任
Assigned --> Submitted : 提交成果()\n[当前承接人且成果完整]\n/ 保存成果与附件
Submitted --> Returned : 审核归档()\n[审核退回且意见完整]\n/ 保留补正责任
Returned --> Submitted : 提交成果()\n[当前承接人且修订完整]\n/ 保存新成果
Submitted --> Archived : 审核归档()\n[目标部门部长或管理员通过且成果齐备]\n/ 保存归档事实
Archived : 审核归档()\n[重复合法请求]\n/ 返回原结果，不改变状态
note bottom of Archived
  外部需求归档是协作完成事实，
  不自动形成津贴贡献。
end note

@enduml
